{"authors":[{"name":"Orchard"}],"description":"Notes from the orchard.","feed_url":"https://orchard.example/feed.json","home_page_url":"https://orchard.example/","items":[{"content_html":"<p>A second post so ordering and tag grouping have something to chew on.</p>\n<pre class=\"lumis\"><code class=\"language-elixir\" translate=\"no\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"l-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"l-keyword-function\">defmodule</span> <span class=\"l-module\">Basket</span> <span class=\"l-keyword\">do</span>\n</div><div class=\"l-line\" data-line=\"2\">  <span class=\"l-keyword-function\">def</span> <span class=\"l-function\">pick</span><span class=\"l-punctuation-bracket\">(</span><span class=\"l-variable\">tree</span><span class=\"l-punctuation-bracket\">)</span><span class=\"l-punctuation-delimiter\">,</span> <span class=\"l-string-special-symbol\">do: </span><span class=\"l-punctuation-bracket\">{</span><span class=\"l-string-special-symbol\">:ok</span><span class=\"l-punctuation-delimiter\">,</span> <span class=\"l-variable\">tree</span><span class=\"l-punctuation-bracket\">}</span>\n</div><div class=\"l-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"l-keyword\">end</span>\n</div></code></pre>","date_published":"2026-02-01T00:00:00Z","id":"https://orchard.example/picking-cherries/","tags":["elixir"],"title":"Picking cherries","url":"https://orchard.example/picking-cherries/"},{"content_html":"<p>The date and slug come from the <strong>filename</strong>; tags ride the shared taxonomy.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GFM lists work</li>\n<li>so does <del>strikethrough</del></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>feature</th>\n<th>status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>tables</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>","date_published":"2026-01-15T00:00:00Z","id":"https://orchard.example/hello-world/","summary":"The first post in the orchard.","tags":["elixir","meta"],"title":"Hello, world","url":"https://orchard.example/hello-world/"}],"title":"Orchard","version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1"}